  "unit": "Unit 7 - More Equation Solving Strategies",
  "description": "Comprehensive lesson covering Unit 7 - More Equation Solving Strategies for SAT Math preparation.",
  "duration": 45,
  "content": "<p><strong>Unit 7 - More Equation Solving Strategies — Title &amp; Goal</strong><br />Comprehensive lesson covering Unit 7 - More Equation Solving Strategies for SAT Math preparation.</p>\n\n<p>Useful when equations are polynomials or involve unknown coefficients.</p>\n<p><strong>Example 1</strong><br />Suppose <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></math>.<br />Expand LHS: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></math>.<br />Match coefficients with RHS:</p><ul><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math></li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></math></li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></math> (checks out)</li></ul>\n<p>So <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></math>.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>For equations with fractions, multiply both sides by the least common denominator (LCD).</p>\n<p><strong>Example 2</strong><br/>\nSolve <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></math><br/>\nLCD = 4. Multiply through:  </p>\n<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>17</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>\n<p><strong>Example 3</strong><br/>\nSolve <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></math><br/>\nLCD = <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>. Multiply through:  </p>\n<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>\n<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>\n<p>Solve quadratic:  </p>\n<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>±</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>±</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>±</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow></math>\n<hr />\n<ul>\n<li>Always check for <strong>restrictions</strong> when clearing denominators (denominators <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>).  </li>\n<li>Matching coefficients often appears in SAT questions with polynomial identities.  </li>\n<li>After clearing denominators, check for <strong>extraneous solutions</strong> by plugging back.  </li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p>1) Solve for <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></math> and <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></math>: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math><br/>\n2) Solve: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></math><br/>\n3) Solve: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></math><br/>\n4) Solve: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></math> </p>\n<hr />\n<p>1) Expand LHS: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></math>. Match with RHS <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math>:</p><ul><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></math></li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></math></li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math> conflict! → no solution.</li></ul>\n<p>2) Multiply through by 6: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>19</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></math> </p>\n<p>3) LCD = <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math><br/>\n   Simplify: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math><br/>\n   Multiply by 4: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></math><br/>\n<br/>\n<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math></p>\n<p>Solve: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>±</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>96</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>±</mi><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></math><br/>\n   → <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math> or <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></math> </p>\n<p>4) LCD = <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math><br/>\n<br/>\n<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></math></p>\n<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></math>\n<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>\n<p>Solve: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>±</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>±</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>28</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>±</mi><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></math><br/>\n   → <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>±</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow></math></p>\n\n<p>Try these on your own. Check your steps, not just the final answer.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Mixed practice set</strong></p>\n<p>These mix everything above. Time yourself and reflect on any mistakes.</p>",
